course: dictionary
lesson: 13371
title: Words about people
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A hater is a noun, a word for a person. Its plural is haters. A hater is someone who hates someone or something. «Jake is a hater of cold weather, so he always wears his big coat in winter.» Hates is the clue: a hater of cold weather really dislikes the cold.
explain: In slang, a hater is someone who is always negative, jealous or rude about other people, especially online. «Ignore the haters, Mia. They only want to make you upset.» The words ignore and upset tell you that haters are unkind people, and that you do not have to let them spoil your day.
explain: Check the meaning by swapping in a simpler phrase. In «Ignore the haters», try «ignore the people who are unkind». It still makes sense, so you have understood it. Remember that the slang meaning can be found in chats and videos, so read the words around it to see which meaning fits.
fact: A hater is a person who hates someone or something.
fact: «Hater» is a noun, and its plural is «haters».
fact: In slang, a hater is someone who is always negative, jealous or rude about other people, especially online.
fact: «Haters gonna hate» is slang meaning that unkind people will keep being unkind, so you do not need to let them upset you.
fact: The phrase «a hater of» is followed by the thing that is disliked, as in «a hater of loud music».
exercise: «Ignore the haters, Mia. Their comments are not true.» What is a hater in this sentence? | A friend who likes all your photos | A teacher marking your work | A person who sells sweets | *Someone who is always negative or rude about others
exercise: What is the plural of hater? | *haters | hates | hater's | hating
exercise: «Jake is a hater of cold weather, so he wears a big coat.» What does hater mean here? | A cold day in winter | *A person who dislikes or hates something | A person who loves something very much | A person who is always cold
test: «Haters gonna hate» means what? | *Unkind people will keep being unkind | Shy people are always quiet | Haters need more sleep | Sad days are very long
test: Which word means someone who is always negative about others online? | Helper | *Hater | Gardener | Hiker
exam: Which sentence uses hater in the slang sense? | *«Ignore the haters, they only want to be unkind.» | «Mum is a hater of cold weather, so she stays indoors.» | «The hater carried the heavy bag up the stairs.» | «The hater of rain brought a red umbrella.»
